# Stage-4 harness, cluster tier (amendment C4 (3), 2026-10-27) of paxos_cache_size-close-active--autonomous.
# Observe-only: on `nodetool getconcurrentviewbuilders` (JMX -> StorageService.getConcurrentViewBuilders(),
# StorageService.java:2031-2034, no internal caller) append one PROBE line via the helper; the method's result is unchanged.
RULE pcca probe RECENT
CLASS org.apache.cassandra.service.StorageService
METHOD getConcurrentViewBuilders
AT ENTRY
IF true
DO stage4.pcca.PcacheProbe.report()
ENDRULE
